  "_readme": [
    "Every string the Flutter SDK renders itself (buttons, placeholders, error",
    "text). NOT the tenant's own copy — greeting, welcome text, offline notice",
    "and survey questions are written in the dashboard, per language.",
    "",
    "Edit the values, keep the keys. An empty string or a missing key falls",
    "back to English at runtime, which is what the gaps below currently do.",
    "",
    "Apply with: python3 flutter-sdk/packages/easylivechat_ui/l10n/apply.py",
    "",
    "Locale codes follow the platform: ckb = Kurdish Sorani, kmr = Badini."
